Ahead is a small shop.
There are many things for the house there.
I stop there.
I see a mug there.
It is a ceramic mug.
It is very beautiful.
It has blue and white colour on it.
I want that mug.
I ask the shopkeeper.
"Bhaiya, how much is this mug for?"
The shopkeeper looks at the mug.
He says, "Madam, this is for five hundred rupees."
Five hundred rupees!
This is very expensive.
I put the mug back.
I smile.
I say, "No bhaiya, thank you."
"I do not need this right now."
I move forward in the market.
